+# Measured on this device: after "VO: [gpu] 640x480 yuvj422p" the KlipperScreen
+# log went completely silent for 2m08s, until the user restarted the service.
+# Injected `xdotool key BackSpace Down Left Left` produced not one line, even
+# though _key_press_event() traces every single press unconditionally.
