+# over loopback, 20 samples: 46KB per frame, 112ms fetch, 20ms decode+scale to
+# 283x212 (median). Both of those run on the worker thread; the main loop only
+# swaps the finished pixbuf into the Gtk.Image. Resident cost is a couple of
+# hundred KB of pixbuf, against ~176MB RSS for the mpv/software-GL path that
+# used to push this 484MB box to 8MB free.
